                                                "sense_id": "994a3472-a298-3a9d-972d-5b01cc62ebec",
                                                "text": "Once, I remember, the little fair-haired boy had a choking fit at dinner, and a stream of snot ran out of his nose on to his plate in a way horrible to see."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5ca7ca02-069d-33db-b389-36ccda399252",
                                        "entry_id": "4b9e0177-e076-38b1-ae99-c4a3da477add",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A contemptible child."
